{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_07e673ba582ffc0b016a95bb98d3bc87d289c0fb60959094f1\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"0c2b9805-9ee1-4776-9099-212029aaebc2\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"0c2b9805-9ee1-4776-9099-212029aaebc2\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_BVDyf0zPWy6SCcMXkexMroei|fc_07e673ba582ffc0b016a95bba2552887d29ea0921617e4cb90","name":"write","arguments":{"i":"Writing repair report","path":"<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/099-083-monorepo-interface-repair-omp-a02-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-083-monorepo-interface-repair-gpt-5.4-20260831-133423-eacf6630/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md","content":"# Interface Fix Report\n\n## Root cause\n`catalog` migrated product pricing from a legacy `price_cents` field to `Product.price: Money(amount_cents, currency)`, but `orders.adapter` still read `product.price_cents` / `product[\"price_cents\"]` and only guessed currency from top-level fields. That broke downstream order pricing for `catalog.Product` objects and left currency handling split across incompatible shapes.\n\n## Changed files\n- `packages/orders/orders/adapter.py`\n  - Added `_price_data(product)` as the boundary adapter for both supported product shapes.\n  - Reads new `Money` pricing from object or dictionary `price` values.\n  - Preserves legacy dictionary support for `price_cents` plus top-level `currency`.\n- `packages/orders/orders/service.py`\n  - Kept mixed-currency validation in the order layer.\n  - Improved the raised error to name both conflicting currencies.\n\n## Verification command\nExecuted from `/workspace/in/shopmono` with a temporary local shim for missing host tools:\n\n`python -m pytest tests`\n\nResult: `5 passed`\n\nAdditional smoke check: legacy product dictionaries still return `300 USD` through `orders.adapter.price_cents()` / `orders.adapter.currency()`.\n"},"intent":"Writing repair report"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_FbzXyindr22KchuPJ5bAHcGy|fc_07e673ba582ffc0b016a95bba2554487d2b9b1a087cf5983a2","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Completing verification tasks","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Run pytest tests","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Completing verification tasks"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3159,"output":494,"cacheRead":23040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26693,"reasoningTokens":37,"cost":{"input":0.0078975,"output":0.00741,"cacheRead":0.0057599999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0210675}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788197782535,"responseId":"resp_07e673ba582ffc0b016a95bb97686c87d280b662cd90e47a33","duration":12078.727696999995,"ttft":2372.789306999999},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_BVDyf0zPWy6SCcMXkexMroei|fc_07e673ba582ffc0b016a95bba2552887d29ea0921617e4cb90","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ENOENT: no such file or directory, open '<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/099-083-monorepo-interface-repair-omp-a02-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-083-monorepo-interface-repair-gpt-5.4-20260831-133423-eacf6630/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md'"}],"details":{},"isError":true,"timestamp":1788197794620},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_FbzXyindr22KchuPJ5bAHcGy|fc_07e673ba582ffc0b016a95bba2554487d2b9b1a087cf5983a2","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items (1):\n  - Write interface fix report [in_progress] (Verification)\nOverall: 7/8 done, 1 open.\nActive phase 3/3 \"Verification\" (1/2).\n  Diagnosis:\n    - [X] Run failing test suite\n    - [X] Inspect price interface usage\n    - [X] Identify compatible repair\n  Implementation:\n    - [X] Update orders price handling\n    - [X] Update reports price handling\n    - [X] Preserve legacy price_cents support\n  Verificat